# Mercedes-Benz 230E (W123) four-door saloon, 1976-1986.
#
# The W123: 4,725 mm long, 1,786 mm wide, 1,430 mm high, 2,795 mm wheelbase;
# 2.0-2.8 petrol and 2.0-3.0 diesel, the 230E the volume petrol model. The
# definitive 1980s executive taxi and company car, about 2.4 million built.
# https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mercedes-Benz_W123
#
# Colours: Black, Brilliant Silver, Nautical Blue and Smoke Silver are period
# Mercedes-Benz finishes.
#
# Weight: 150 in total (black 50, silver 40, blue 30, grey 30).
#
# Speed 190 km/h; comfort 110/495 (line). Classes 2,3.
# Dates: 1976-1986 with a road tail to about 1998.
#
# Metres master: citycars/4.5/mercedes-w123.blend. References:
# citycars/references/mercedes-w123/ (gitignored). Images via Wikimedia Commons.

